window.VisaAtlasWrittenCatalogs={"fr":{"lessons":[{"title":"Votre projet d’études","summary":"Expliquez ce que vous souhaitez étudier et pourquoi.","intro":"On peut vous demander pourquoi vous avez choisi les États-Unis, cet établissement ou cette formation.","structure":"Dites ce que vous étudierez et où, puis donnez une raison personnelle et précise.","points":["Expliquez votre intérêt pour la matière à partir d’un cours, d’une expérience ou de ce que vous souhaitez apprendre.","Donnez une raison réelle de choisir les États-Unis, fondée sur ce que vous avez vérifié concernant votre formation.","Citez un cours, un projet ou une caractéristique de l’établissement que vous avez vérifiés. Comparez uniquement les établissements réellement envisagés."],"questions":["Pourquoi cette matière vous intéresse-t-elle ?","Pourquoi cet établissement et les États-Unis ?","Qu’aimeriez-vous apprendre ?"],"prompts":["Pourquoi cette matière vous intéresse-t-elle ?","Pourquoi cet établissement et les États-Unis ?","Qu’aimeriez-vous apprendre ?"],"example":"Je souhaite étudier [matière] à [établissement], parce que [raison réelle]."},{"title":"Votre parcours scolaire","summary":"Présentez vos études et ce que vous avez fait depuis.","intro":"Ces questions portent sur votre parcours et votre décision de poursuivre vos études.","structure":"Présentez vos études, les dates et vos activités suivantes avec vos résultats réels.","points":["Soyez honnête sur vos notes et expliquez toute interruption ou tout changement d’établissement.","Pour un master ou un doctorat, reliez vos études, votre travail ou vos recherches à la nouvelle formation. Expliquez honnêtement un changement de domaine.","Distinguez les études terminées de celles en cours. Une date de fin prévue n’est pas un diplôme déjà obtenu."],"questions":["Qu’étudiez-vous ou qu’avez-vous étudié, et quand ?","Qu’avez-vous fait depuis, ou que faites-vous actuellement ?","Pourquoi poursuivre cette formation maintenant ?"],"prompts":["Qu’étudiez-vous ou qu’avez-vous étudié, et quand ?","Qu’avez-vous fait depuis, ou que faites-vous actuellement ?","Pourquoi poursuivre cette formation maintenant ?"],"example":"J’étudie actuellement ou j’ai terminé [formation] en [année réelle ou prévue]. Depuis, [activité réelle]."},{"title":"Votre financement","summary":"Expliquez qui paie et quelles dépenses sont couvertes.","intro":"On peut vous demander comment vous paierez les études et la vie quotidienne.","structure":"Présentez les financeurs, les montants confirmés, les conditions et les frais restants.","points":["Vérifiez les frais de scolarité, le logement, la nourriture et les autres dépenses pour la même période. Vérifiez aussi le voyage, l’été et l’assurance.","Si vous avez une bourse, expliquez comment vous l’avez obtenue et ce que confirme la lettre d’attribution. Ne supposez pas qu’une bourse « complète » couvre tout.","Précisez qui paie le reste, votre lien avec cette personne et l’origine des fonds. Vérifiez les détails inconnus ; ne supposez pas des parts égales."],"questions":["Qui finance vos études ?","Que couvre le financement confirmé, et à quelles conditions ?","Comment les frais restants seront-ils payés ?"],"prompts":["Qui finance vos études ?","Que couvre le financement confirmé, et à quelles conditions ?","Comment les frais restants seront-ils payés ?"],"example":"[Source réelle] financera [frais confirmés]. Les frais restants seront couverts par [source confirmée]."},{"title":"Vos projets futurs","summary":"Expliquez ce que vous souhaitez faire après vos études.","intro":"Reliez votre formation à vos objectifs réels.","structure":"Présentez votre objectif, les compétences utiles et ce qui reste à décider.","points":["Expliquez comment votre formation peut vous aider dans votre travail ou vos études futures.","Distinguez les arrangements confirmés des projets que vous espérez réaliser. Certaines décisions peuvent encore être ouvertes.","N’inventez pas d’offre d’emploi, d’obligation familiale ou de promesse de retour. Mentionnez le sport seulement s’il fait réellement partie de vos projets."],"questions":["Que souhaitez-vous faire après vos études ?","Comment cette formation vous aidera-t-elle ?","Qu’est-ce qui est confirmé et qu’envisagez-vous encore ?"],"prompts":["Que souhaitez-vous faire après vos études ?","Comment cette formation vous aidera-t-elle ?","Qu’est-ce qui est confirmé et qu’envisagez-vous encore ?"],"example":"Après mes études, je souhaite [objectif réel]. Cette formation m’aidera à développer [compétences utiles]."},{"title":"Votre situation","summary":"Présentez les demandes précédentes et les changements pertinents.","intro":"Travaillez uniquement les sujets qui vous concernent.","structure":"Expliquez ce qui s’est passé, ce qui a changé et ce qui est confirmé aujourd’hui.","points":["Si vous avez reçu un refus, décrivez les faits et les changements éventuels. Un nouvel établissement ou document ne garantit pas une approbation.","En cas de changement d’établissement ou de date, expliquez pourquoi et vérifiez les dispositions avec l’établissement.","Si le sport vous concerne, expliquez votre recrutement, vos résultats et comment vous concilierez sport et études. N’inventez pas d’engagement confirmé."],"questions":["Avez-vous déjà présenté une demande ? Qu’est-ce qui a changé ?","Votre établissement ou votre date de début ont-ils changé ?","Si le sport vous concerne, comment avez-vous été recruté ?"],"prompts":["Avez-vous déjà présenté une demande ? Qu’est-ce qui a changé ?","Votre établissement ou votre date de début ont-ils changé ?","Si le sport vous concerne, comment avez-vous été recruté ?"],"example":"[Situation réelle]. Ce qui a changé : [changement éventuel]. Les dispositions confirmées sont [faits]."},{"title":"Entraînement à l’entretien","summary":"Entraînez-vous à répondre brièvement avant l’entretien blanc.","intro":"Les questions peuvent arriver dans un ordre différent.","structure":"Répondez à la question, ajoutez un détail utile, puis faites une pause.","points":["Écoutez attentivement. Employez vos propres mots plutôt qu’un discours mémorisé.","Travaillez les études, le financement et l’avenir. Gardez les mêmes faits quand la formulation change.","Demandez de répéter ou d’expliquer si nécessaire. Dites quand vous ignorez un détail. Utilisez le rapport pour choisir votre prochain exercice."],"questions":["À quelles questions répondez-vous clairement ?","Que devez-vous encore vérifier ou travailler ?","Que souhaitez-vous améliorer pendant l’entretien blanc ?"],"prompts":["À quelles questions répondez-vous clairement ?","Que devez-vous encore vérifier ou travailler ?","Que souhaitez-vous améliorer pendant l’entretien blanc ?"],"example":"J’ai choisi [établissement] parce que [raison réelle]. J’ai vérifié [détail pertinent]."}],"levels":{"high-school":"Pour le secondaire, parlez de votre classe actuelle et de vos matières. Ne supposez pas avoir déjà terminé. Vérifiez le logement et l’accompagnement par un adulte ou l’établissement. Un métier ou une spécialité universitaire n’a pas besoin d’être déjà choisi.","undergraduate":"Pour le premier cycle universitaire, expliquez vos études secondaires, vos éventuelles études supérieures et les transferts ou interruptions réels. Distinguez votre niveau prévu de votre situation actuelle.","masters":"Pour le master, reliez votre diplôme précédent et votre expérience à cette formation. Vérifiez les conditions réelles des bourses ou postes d’assistant.","phd":"Pour le doctorat, expliquez votre recherche simplement. Distinguez un encadrant espéré d’un accord confirmé. Ne supposez pas un financement complet ; vérifiez sa durée, ses conditions et les frais restants."},"strings":{"Your learning path":"Votre parcours d’apprentissage","Your students’ learning":"L’apprentissage de vos élèves","Continue your preparation for your F-1 interview.":"Poursuivez votre préparation à l’entretien F-1.","Learn in your language":"Apprenez dans votre langue","Learning language":"Langue d’apprentissage","Choose the language for lessons and your voice tutor. Mock interview language is separate.":"Choisissez la langue des leçons et du tuteur vocal. La langue de l’entretien blanc est indépendante.","Choose before starting a session. Your notes stay in the language you wrote them.":"Choisissez avant de démarrer. Vos notes restent dans leur langue d’origine.","Choose a module":"Choisissez un module","Completion tracks your learning, not visa approval or interview readiness.":"La progression suit votre apprentissage, pas l’approbation du visa ni votre préparation à l’entretien.","← Back to all modules":"← Tous les modules","1. Learn":"1. Apprendre","Understand the question":"Comprendre la question","How to answer":"Comment répondre","See an example":"Voir un exemple","Use your actual facts. Note anything you still need to check.":"Utilisez vos faits réels. Notez ce qui reste à vérifier.","2. Practise with your tutor":"2. S’entraîner avec le tuteur","Your tutor explains, gives an example, and helps you practise in your own words. Ask “explain more” if you need help, or say “next” to move on.":"Le tuteur explique, donne un exemple et vous aide à répondre avec vos mots. Demandez « explique davantage » ou dites « suivant » pour continuer.","Ready to start":"Prêt à commencer","Start voice lesson":"Démarrer la leçon vocale","End lesson conversation":"Terminer la conversation","Voice lessons last up to 8 minutes. Daily practice attempts are unlimited. Reading and notes remain available.":"Les leçons vocales durent jusqu’à 8 minutes. Les essais quotidiens sont illimités. La lecture et les notes restent disponibles.","Your conversation is for learning, with no readiness score. Save the points you want to keep in your notes; the conversation itself is not saved.":"Cette conversation sert à apprendre, sans score. Gardez les points utiles dans vos notes ; la conversation n’est pas enregistrée.","My notes — optional":"Mes notes — facultatif","You do not need to write anything to finish. Your saved notes stay here if you want to use them.":"Écrire n’est pas obligatoire. Vos notes enregistrées restent disponibles ici.","Questions you can practise aloud or write about:":"Questions à travailler à l’oral ou à l’écrit :","Anything you want to remember":"Ce que vous souhaitez retenir","Save notes":"Enregistrer les notes","3. Finish this module":"3. Terminer ce module","By completing this module, you confirm that you reviewed it and practised an answer. You can practise with the tutor or on your own.":"En terminant, vous confirmez avoir étudié le module et travaillé une réponse, avec le tuteur ou seul.","Complete module & continue →":"Terminer et continuer →","Complete module & go to mock interview →":"Terminer et passer à l’entretien blanc →","Retry loading lesson":"Réessayer de charger","Completion records your progress through this lesson, not an assessment of readiness. You can revisit it any time.":"La validation suit votre progression, pas votre niveau de préparation. Vous pouvez revenir à tout moment.","Completed":"Terminé","In progress":"En cours","Not started":"Pas commencé","Not completed":"Non terminé","Module":"Module","Review your course":"Revoir le cours","Continue lesson":"Continuer la leçon","Use your actual facts; note anything you need to check.":"Utilisez vos faits réels ; notez ce qui reste à vérifier.","This is an example template, not a statement about you. Replace brackets with confirmed facts; do not memorize it.":"Ceci est un modèle, pas une affirmation à votre sujet. Remplacez les crochets par des faits confirmés ; ne le mémorisez pas.","Unsaved changes":"Modifications non enregistrées","Loading your notes…":"Chargement des notes…","Saving…":"Enregistrement…","Notes saved. You can return to them later.":"Notes enregistrées. Vous pourrez les consulter plus tard.","Earlier notes saved. You have new unsaved changes.":"Anciennes notes enregistrées. De nouvelles modifications restent à enregistrer.","Lesson complete. You can keep practising or try a mock interview.":"Leçon terminée. Continuez à pratiquer ou essayez un entretien blanc.","Unlimited tutoring starts. Session time limits still apply.":"Démarrages illimités. La durée des sessions reste limitée.","Up to 8 minutes. Voice stops automatically at the limit.":"Jusqu’à 8 minutes. La voix s’arrête automatiquement à la limite.","Your tutor is responding…":"Votre tuteur répond…","Focus first":"Priorité","Your next steps":"Vos prochaines étapes","More next steps":"Autres étapes","What went well":"Points positifs","Points to clarify":"Points à clarifier","There is not enough evidence in this interview to identify a clear strength yet.":"Cet entretien ne fournit pas encore assez d’éléments pour identifier un point fort.","No specific improvement identified in the answers assessed.":"Aucune amélioration précise relevée dans les réponses évaluées.","No specific weakness identified from the answers assessed.":"Aucun point faible précis relevé dans les réponses évaluées.","Interview feedback":"Retour sur l’entretien","Next step":"Prochaine étape","What to work on next":"Prochain point à travailler","Practise this":"Travailler ce point","How your score was calculated":"Calcul de votre score","Overall preparation":"Préparation générale","Partial practice score":"Score partiel d’entraînement","Practice readiness":"Préparation à l’exercice","Practice score":"Score d’entraînement","Practice preparation score":"Score de préparation","Interview incomplete":"Entretien incomplet","Partial interview · assessed answers only":"Entretien partiel · réponses évaluées uniquement","Not enough information to score":"Informations insuffisantes pour un score","Feedback on this practice interview, not a prediction of visa approval.":"Retour sur cet exercice, pas une prédiction d’approbation du visa.","Practice feedback only. This is not a prediction or guarantee of visa approval.":"Retour d’entraînement uniquement. Ce n’est ni une prédiction ni une garantie d’approbation du visa.","Interview coverage":"Sujets abordés","Partial interview · keep practising the remaining areas":"Entretien partiel · travaillez les sujets restants","Not assessed — no points earned yet":"Non évalué — aucun point obtenu pour le moment","Not covered — not counted against you":"Non abordé — sans pénalité","All relevant main areas were covered.":"Tous les sujets principaux pertinents ont été abordés.","Not assessed":"Non évalué","Assessed":"Évalué","Not scored":"Sans score","Ready":"Prêt","Almost Ready":"Presque prêt","Needs Significant Prep":"Préparation importante nécessaire","High Concern":"Points importants à travailler","Standard":"Standard","Challenging":"Approfondi","Intensive":"Intensif","Study plans":"Projet d’études","School choice":"Choix de l’établissement","Your subject":"Votre matière","Academic history":"Parcours scolaire","Funding":"Financement","Future plans":"Projets futurs","Previous applications and travel":"Demandes et voyages précédents","Print / save report as PDF":"Imprimer / enregistrer en PDF","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimer / enregistrer en PDF","Download report (PDF)":"Télécharger le rapport (PDF)","Opens a print-ready report. Choose Save as PDF in your browser.":"Ouvre un rapport imprimable. Choisissez Enregistrer en PDF dans le navigateur.","F-1 INTERVIEW PRACTICE REPORT":"RAPPORT D’ENTRAÎNEMENT À L’ENTRETIEN F-1","Topic coverage and scores":"Sujets et scores","Scoring basis":"Base du calcul","Not assessed means no points earned yet; it does not mean a wrong answer.":"Non évalué signifie aucun point obtenu pour le moment, pas une mauvaise réponse.","Each assessed topic is scored out of 10. The average is converted to a score out of 100. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Chaque sujet évalué est noté sur 10. La moyenne est convertie sur 100. Les sujets sans réponse sont exclus.","At least two distinct substantive answers are needed for a score. Feedback is still available.":"Il faut au moins deux réponses substantielles distinctes pour un score. Le retour reste disponible.","All seven areas were assessed.":"Les sept sujets ont été évalués.","Interview incomplete. Unassessed areas earn no points yet; this does not mean their answers were wrong.":"Entretien incomplet. Les sujets non évalués ne rapportent pas encore de points ; cela ne signifie pas que les réponses étaient fausses.","Try another mock to cover the topics listed below.":"Essayez un autre entretien pour aborder les sujets ci-dessous.","Keep practising clear answers in your own words.":"Continuez à travailler des réponses claires avec vos mots.","Human review":"Évaluation humaine","Add human review":"Ajouter une évaluation humaine","Student":"Élève","Not recorded":"Non renseigné","Mode not recorded":"Mode non renseigné","No written feedback was recorded.":"Aucun retour écrit enregistré.","Detailed topic assessments were not recorded for this historical report.":"Les évaluations détaillées n’ont pas été enregistrées pour cet ancien rapport.","Private practice feedback":"Retour privé d’entraînement","Choose Save as PDF in the print dialog. On iPhone, use Share → Print to preview and save the report.":"Choisissez Enregistrer en PDF dans la fenêtre d’impression. Sur iPhone, utilisez Partager → Imprimer pour prévisualiser et enregistrer.","Scoring basis: assessed topic scores only. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Calcul basé uniquement sur les sujets évalués. Les sujets sans réponse sont exclus.","Assessed topic scores only; unanswered topics are excluded.":"Sujets évalués uniquement ; les sujets sans réponse sont exclus.","Assessed - score not recorded":"Évalué — score non enregistré","Focused practice":"Entraînement ciblé","Review this feedback with your tutor. Starting this lesson does not mark the issue as resolved.":"Revoyez ce retour avec le tuteur. Commencer ne signifie pas que le point est résolu.","Return to regular lesson":"Retour à la leçon","A student profile is needed to save notes or start a lesson.":"Un profil élève est nécessaire pour enregistrer les notes ou démarrer.","An answer, a useful point, or something to check later.":"Une réponse, un point utile ou quelque chose à vérifier.","Requesting microphone…":"Accès au microphone…","Listening — answer when you’re ready.":"À l’écoute — répondez quand vous êtes prêt.","One minute remaining in this voice session.":"Il reste une minute.","Switch modules without saving these notes?":"Changer de module sans enregistrer les notes ?","Return to modules without saving your changes?":"Revenir aux modules sans enregistrer ?","Switch students without saving these notes?":"Changer d’élève sans enregistrer les notes ?"},"formats":{"progress":"{0} modules terminés sur {1}","module":"Module {0} sur {1}","coverage":"{0} sujets évalués sur {1}","score":"{0} points sur {1}, pour les sept sujets, convertis en score sur 100.","quality":"Qualité des sujets traités : {0}/100. Moyenne des sujets évalués uniquement.","date":"Date de l’exercice : {0}","mock":"Entretien blanc n° {0}","adjusted":"Score ajusté : {0}/100","reviewer":"Évaluateur : {0}"}},"es":{"lessons":[{"title":"Tus planes de estudio","summary":"Explica qué quieres estudiar y por qué.","intro":"Pueden preguntarte por qué elegiste Estados Unidos, tu centro o tu programa.","structure":"Di qué estudiarás y dónde, y añade una razón personal y concreta.","points":["Explica tu interés por la materia con una clase, una experiencia o algo que quieras aprender.","Da una razón real para elegir Estados Unidos, basada en lo que has comprobado sobre el programa.","Menciona un curso, proyecto o característica del centro que hayas verificado. Compara solo los centros que realmente consideraste."],"questions":["¿Por qué te interesa esta materia?","¿Por qué este centro y Estados Unidos?","¿Qué te gustaría aprender?"],"prompts":["¿Por qué te interesa esta materia?","¿Por qué este centro y Estados Unidos?","¿Qué te gustaría aprender?"],"example":"Quiero estudiar [materia] en [centro] porque [razón real]."},{"title":"Tu trayectoria académica","summary":"Describe tus estudios y lo que has hecho desde entonces.","intro":"Estas preguntas tratan sobre tu formación y por qué quieres seguir estudiando.","structure":"Explica tus estudios, fechas y actividades posteriores con resultados reales.","points":["Sé honesto sobre tus notas y explica cualquier pausa o cambio de centro.","Para un máster o doctorado, relaciona tus estudios, trabajo o investigación con el nuevo programa. Explica con sinceridad un cambio de campo.","Distingue los estudios terminados de los que siguen en curso. Una fecha prevista de finalización no es un título ya obtenido."],"questions":["¿Qué estudias o has estudiado, y cuándo?","¿Qué has hecho desde entonces o qué haces actualmente?","¿Por qué quieres cursar este programa ahora?"],"prompts":["¿Qué estudias o has estudiado, y cuándo?","¿Qué has hecho desde entonces o qué haces actualmente?","¿Por qué quieres cursar este programa ahora?"],"example":"Actualmente estudio o terminé [formación] en [año real o previsto]. Desde entonces, [actividad real]."},{"title":"Tu financiación","summary":"Explica quién paga y qué gastos cubre.","intro":"Pueden preguntarte cómo pagarás los estudios y los gastos de vida.","structure":"Indica las fuentes, cantidades confirmadas, condiciones y gastos pendientes.","points":["Comprueba matrícula, alojamiento, comida y otros gastos para el mismo periodo. Revisa también viajes, verano y seguro.","Si tienes una beca, explica cómo la obtuviste y qué confirma la carta de concesión. No supongas que una beca «completa» cubre todo.","Explica quién pagará lo restante, tu relación con esa persona y de dónde procede el dinero. Verifica lo que no sepas; no supongas aportaciones iguales."],"questions":["¿Quién financia tus estudios?","¿Qué cubre la financiación confirmada y con qué condiciones?","¿Cómo se pagarán los gastos restantes?"],"prompts":["¿Quién financia tus estudios?","¿Qué cubre la financiación confirmada y con qué condiciones?","¿Cómo se pagarán los gastos restantes?"],"example":"[Fuente real] pagará [gastos confirmados]. Los gastos restantes los cubrirá [fuente confirmada]."},{"title":"Tus planes futuros","summary":"Explica qué quieres hacer después de estudiar.","intro":"Relaciona tus estudios con tus objetivos reales.","structure":"Presenta tu objetivo, las habilidades útiles y lo que queda por decidir.","points":["Explica cómo el programa puede ayudarte en tu trabajo o estudios futuros.","Distingue los acuerdos confirmados de tus aspiraciones. Está bien si algunas decisiones siguen abiertas.","No inventes ofertas de trabajo, obligaciones familiares ni promesas de regresar. Menciona el deporte solo si forma parte real de tus planes."],"questions":["¿Qué quieres hacer después de estudiar?","¿Cómo te ayudará este programa?","¿Qué está confirmado y qué sigues considerando?"],"prompts":["¿Qué quieres hacer después de estudiar?","¿Cómo te ayudará este programa?","¿Qué está confirmado y qué sigues considerando?"],"example":"Después de estudiar, quiero [objetivo real]. Este programa me ayudará a desarrollar [habilidades útiles]."},{"title":"Tus circunstancias","summary":"Habla de solicitudes anteriores y cambios relevantes.","intro":"Practica solo los temas que se apliquen a ti.","structure":"Explica qué ocurrió, qué cambió y qué está confirmado ahora.","points":["Si recibiste una denegación, explica los hechos y los cambios, si los hubo. Un centro o documento nuevo no garantiza la aprobación.","Si cambió el centro o la fecha de inicio, explica por qué y comprueba los nuevos acuerdos con el centro.","Si practicas deporte, explica cómo te reclutaron, tus resultados y cómo combinarás estudios y deporte. No inventes compromisos confirmados."],"questions":["¿Has presentado solicitudes antes? ¿Qué ha cambiado?","¿Han cambiado tu centro o la fecha de inicio?","Si practicas deporte, ¿cómo te reclutaron?"],"prompts":["¿Has presentado solicitudes antes? ¿Qué ha cambiado?","¿Han cambiado tu centro o la fecha de inicio?","Si practicas deporte, ¿cómo te reclutaron?"],"example":"[Situación real]. Lo que ha cambiado: [cambio, si lo hay]. Los acuerdos confirmados son [hechos]."},{"title":"Práctica de entrevista","summary":"Practica respuestas breves antes de la entrevista simulada.","intro":"Las preguntas pueden llegar en un orden distinto.","structure":"Responde a la pregunta, añade un detalle útil y haz una pausa.","points":["Escucha con atención. Usa tus propias palabras en lugar de un discurso memorizado.","Practica estudios, financiación y planes futuros. Mantén los mismos hechos aunque cambie la pregunta.","Pide que repitan o expliquen si lo necesitas. Reconoce cuando no sabes un detalle. Usa el informe para elegir qué practicar después."],"questions":["¿Qué preguntas puedes responder con claridad?","¿Qué necesitas comprobar o practicar todavía?","¿Qué quieres mejorar en la entrevista simulada?"],"prompts":["¿Qué preguntas puedes responder con claridad?","¿Qué necesitas comprobar o practicar todavía?","¿Qué quieres mejorar en la entrevista simulada?"],"example":"Elegí [centro] porque [razón real]. Comprobé [detalle relevante]."}],"levels":{"high-school":"Para secundaria, habla de tu curso actual y tus materias. No supongas que ya terminaste. Comprueba alojamiento y apoyo de un adulto o del centro. No necesitas haber elegido carrera o especialidad universitaria.","undergraduate":"Para grado universitario, explica tu educación secundaria, estudios superiores y cambios o pausas reales. Distingue el nivel que planeas empezar de tu situación actual.","masters":"Para máster, relaciona tu título previo y tu experiencia con el programa. Comprueba las condiciones reales de becas o puestos de asistente.","phd":"Para doctorado, explica la investigación con sencillez. Distingue un posible supervisor de un acuerdo confirmado. No supongas financiación completa; comprueba duración, condiciones y gastos restantes."},"strings":{"Your learning path":"Tu ruta de aprendizaje","Your students’ learning":"El aprendizaje de tus estudiantes","Continue your preparation for your F-1 interview.":"Continúa preparándote para tu entrevista F-1.","Learn in your language":"Aprende en tu idioma","Learning language":"Idioma de aprendizaje","Choose the language for lessons and your voice tutor. Mock interview language is separate.":"Elige el idioma de las lecciones y del tutor de voz. El idioma de la entrevista es independiente.","Choose before starting a session. Your notes stay in the language you wrote them.":"Elige antes de empezar. Tus notas conservan el idioma en que las escribiste.","Choose a module":"Elige un módulo","Completion tracks your learning, not visa approval or interview readiness.":"Completar módulos registra aprendizaje, no aprobación de visa ni preparación para la entrevista.","← Back to all modules":"← Todos los módulos","1. Learn":"1. Aprender","Understand the question":"Entiende la pregunta","How to answer":"Cómo responder","See an example":"Ver un ejemplo","Use your actual facts. Note anything you still need to check.":"Usa tus datos reales. Anota lo que debas comprobar.","2. Practise with your tutor":"2. Practica con tu tutor","Your tutor explains, gives an example, and helps you practise in your own words. Ask “explain more” if you need help, or say “next” to move on.":"El tutor explica, da un ejemplo y te ayuda a practicar con tus palabras. Pide «explica más» o di «siguiente» para continuar.","Ready to start":"Listo para empezar","Start voice lesson":"Iniciar lección de voz","End lesson conversation":"Terminar conversación","Voice lessons last up to 8 minutes. Daily practice attempts are unlimited. Reading and notes remain available.":"Las lecciones de voz duran hasta 8 minutos. Los intentos diarios son ilimitados. La lectura y las notas siguen disponibles.","Your conversation is for learning, with no readiness score. Save the points you want to keep in your notes; the conversation itself is not saved.":"Esta conversación es para aprender, sin puntuación. Guarda lo útil en tus notas; la conversación no se guarda.","My notes — optional":"Mis notas — opcional","You do not need to write anything to finish. Your saved notes stay here if you want to use them.":"No necesitas escribir para terminar. Tus notas guardadas quedan aquí.","Questions you can practise aloud or write about:":"Preguntas para practicar hablando o escribiendo:","Anything you want to remember":"Lo que quieras recordar","Save notes":"Guardar notas","3. Finish this module":"3. Termina este módulo","By completing this module, you confirm that you reviewed it and practised an answer. You can practise with the tutor or on your own.":"Al completar, confirmas que revisaste el módulo y practicaste una respuesta, con el tutor o por tu cuenta.","Complete module & continue →":"Completar y continuar →","Complete module & go to mock interview →":"Completar e ir a la entrevista →","Retry loading lesson":"Reintentar cargar","Completion records your progress through this lesson, not an assessment of readiness. You can revisit it any time.":"Completar registra progreso, no una evaluación de preparación. Puedes volver cuando quieras.","Completed":"Completado","In progress":"En curso","Not started":"Sin empezar","Not completed":"Sin completar","Module":"Módulo","Review your course":"Repasar el curso","Continue lesson":"Continuar lección","Use your actual facts; note anything you need to check.":"Usa tus datos reales; anota lo que debas comprobar.","This is an example template, not a statement about you. Replace brackets with confirmed facts; do not memorize it.":"Es una plantilla, no una afirmación sobre ti. Sustituye los corchetes por hechos confirmados; no la memorices.","Unsaved changes":"Cambios sin guardar","Loading your notes…":"Cargando notas…","Saving…":"Guardando…","Notes saved. You can return to them later.":"Notas guardadas. Puedes volver después.","Earlier notes saved. You have new unsaved changes.":"Notas anteriores guardadas. Hay cambios nuevos sin guardar.","Lesson complete. You can keep practising or try a mock interview.":"Lección completada. Sigue practicando o prueba una entrevista.","Unlimited tutoring starts. Session time limits still apply.":"Inicios de tutoría ilimitados. Sigue aplicándose el límite por sesión.","Up to 8 minutes. Voice stops automatically at the limit.":"Hasta 8 minutos. La voz se detiene automáticamente al llegar al límite.","Your tutor is responding…":"Tu tutor está respondiendo…","Focus first":"Prioridad","Your next steps":"Tus próximos pasos","More next steps":"Más pasos","What went well":"Lo que salió bien","Points to clarify":"Puntos por aclarar","There is not enough evidence in this interview to identify a clear strength yet.":"Todavía no hay suficiente evidencia para identificar una fortaleza clara.","No specific improvement identified in the answers assessed.":"No se identificó una mejora concreta en las respuestas evaluadas.","No specific weakness identified from the answers assessed.":"No se identificó una debilidad concreta en las respuestas evaluadas.","Interview feedback":"Comentarios de la entrevista","Next step":"Siguiente paso","What to work on next":"Qué practicar después","Practise this":"Practicar esto","How your score was calculated":"Cómo se calculó tu puntuación","Overall preparation":"Preparación general","Partial practice score":"Puntuación parcial de práctica","Practice readiness":"Preparación para la práctica","Practice score":"Puntuación de práctica","Practice preparation score":"Puntuación de preparación","Interview incomplete":"Entrevista incompleta","Partial interview · assessed answers only":"Entrevista parcial · solo respuestas evaluadas","Not enough information to score":"Información insuficiente para puntuar","Feedback on this practice interview, not a prediction of visa approval.":"Comentarios sobre esta práctica, no una predicción de aprobación de visa.","Practice feedback only. This is not a prediction or guarantee of visa approval.":"Solo comentarios de práctica. No predice ni garantiza la aprobación de visa.","Interview coverage":"Cobertura de la entrevista","Partial interview · keep practising the remaining areas":"Entrevista parcial · practica las áreas restantes","Not assessed — no points earned yet":"Sin evaluar — aún sin puntos","Not covered — not counted against you":"No cubierto — sin penalización","All relevant main areas were covered.":"Se cubrieron todas las áreas principales pertinentes.","Not assessed":"Sin evaluar","Assessed":"Evaluado","Not scored":"Sin puntuación","Ready":"Preparado","Almost Ready":"Casi preparado","Needs Significant Prep":"Necesita bastante preparación","High Concern":"Aspectos importantes por mejorar","Standard":"Estándar","Challenging":"Exigente","Intensive":"Intensivo","Study plans":"Planes de estudio","School choice":"Elección del centro","Your subject":"Tu materia","Academic history":"Historia académica","Funding":"Financiación","Future plans":"Planes futuros","Previous applications and travel":"Solicitudes y viajes anteriores","Print / save report as PDF":"Imprimir / guardar informe PDF","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimir / guardar PDF","Download report (PDF)":"Descargar informe (PDF)","Opens a print-ready report. Choose Save as PDF in your browser.":"Abre un informe para imprimir. Elige Guardar como PDF en el navegador.","F-1 INTERVIEW PRACTICE REPORT":"INFORME DE PRÁCTICA DE ENTREVISTA F-1","Topic coverage and scores":"Temas y puntuaciones","Scoring basis":"Base de puntuación","Not assessed means no points earned yet; it does not mean a wrong answer.":"Sin evaluar significa que aún no hay puntos, no que la respuesta sea incorrecta.","Each assessed topic is scored out of 10. The average is converted to a score out of 100. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Cada tema evaluado se puntúa sobre 10. La media se convierte a 100. Se excluyen temas sin respuesta.","At least two distinct substantive answers are needed for a score. Feedback is still available.":"Se necesitan al menos dos respuestas sustanciales distintas para puntuar. Los comentarios siguen disponibles.","All seven areas were assessed.":"Se evaluaron las siete áreas.","Interview incomplete. Unassessed areas earn no points yet; this does not mean their answers were wrong.":"Entrevista incompleta. Las áreas sin evaluar aún no suman puntos; esto no significa que sus respuestas fueran incorrectas.","Try another mock to cover the topics listed below.":"Prueba otra entrevista para cubrir los temas siguientes.","Keep practising clear answers in your own words.":"Sigue practicando respuestas claras con tus palabras.","Human review":"Revisión humana","Add human review":"Añadir revisión humana","Student":"Estudiante","Not recorded":"No registrado","Mode not recorded":"Modo no registrado","No written feedback was recorded.":"No se registraron comentarios escritos.","Detailed topic assessments were not recorded for this historical report.":"Este informe antiguo no tiene evaluaciones detalladas registradas.","Private practice feedback":"Comentarios privados de práctica","Choose Save as PDF in the print dialog. On iPhone, use Share → Print to preview and save the report.":"Elige Guardar como PDF en el diálogo de impresión. En iPhone, usa Compartir → Imprimir para ver y guardar.","Scoring basis: assessed topic scores only. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Solo se puntúan los temas evaluados. Se excluyen los no respondidos.","Assessed topic scores only; unanswered topics are excluded.":"Solo temas evaluados; se excluyen los no respondidos.","Assessed - score not recorded":"Evaluado — puntuación no registrada","Focused practice":"Práctica enfocada","Review this feedback with your tutor. Starting this lesson does not mark the issue as resolved.":"Revisa estos comentarios con tu tutor. Empezar no significa resolver el problema.","Return to regular lesson":"Volver a la lección","A student profile is needed to save notes or start a lesson.":"Se necesita un perfil para guardar notas o empezar.","An answer, a useful point, or something to check later.":"Una respuesta, algo útil o algo para comprobar después.","Requesting microphone…":"Solicitando micrófono…","Listening — answer when you’re ready.":"Escuchando — responde cuando quieras.","One minute remaining in this voice session.":"Queda un minuto.","Switch modules without saving these notes?":"¿Cambiar sin guardar las notas?","Return to modules without saving your changes?":"¿Volver sin guardar los cambios?","Switch students without saving these notes?":"¿Cambiar de estudiante sin guardar?"},"formats":{"progress":"{0} de {1} módulos completados","module":"Módulo {0} de {1}","coverage":"{0} de {1} áreas evaluadas","score":"{0} puntos de {1} en las siete áreas, convertidos a una puntuación sobre 100.","quality":"Calidad de temas respondidos: {0}/100. Media solo de áreas evaluadas.","date":"Fecha de práctica: {0}","mock":"Entrevista n.º {0}","adjusted":"Puntuación ajustada: {0}/100","reviewer":"Evaluador: {0}"}},"pt":{"lessons":[{"title":"Seus planos de estudo","summary":"Explique o que quer estudar e por quê.","intro":"Podem perguntar por que você escolheu os Estados Unidos, a instituição ou o curso.","structure":"Diga o que vai estudar e onde, e acrescente uma razão pessoal e concreta.","points":["Explique seu interesse pela área com uma aula, uma experiência ou algo que queira aprender.","Dê uma razão real para escolher os Estados Unidos, baseada no que verificou sobre o curso.","Cite uma disciplina, projeto ou característica da instituição que você verificou. Compare apenas instituições que realmente considerou."],"questions":["Por que essa área interessa a você?","Por que essa instituição e os Estados Unidos?","O que gostaria de aprender?"],"prompts":["Por que essa área interessa a você?","Por que essa instituição e os Estados Unidos?","O que gostaria de aprender?"],"example":"Quero estudar [área] em [instituição] porque [razão real]."},{"title":"Sua trajetória acadêmica","summary":"Fale sobre seus estudos e o que fez desde então.","intro":"Estas perguntas tratam da sua formação e da decisão de continuar estudando.","structure":"Explique seus estudos, datas e atividades seguintes com resultados reais.","points":["Seja honesto sobre suas notas e explique pausas ou mudanças de instituição.","Para mestrado ou doutorado, relacione estudos, trabalho ou pesquisa ao novo curso. Explique uma mudança de área com honestidade.","Diferencie estudos concluídos dos que estão em andamento. Uma data prevista de conclusão não é um diploma já obtido."],"questions":["O que você estuda ou estudou, e quando?","O que fez desde então ou está fazendo agora?","Por que quer fazer esse curso agora?"],"prompts":["O que você estuda ou estudou, e quando?","O que fez desde então ou está fazendo agora?","Por que quer fazer esse curso agora?"],"example":"Atualmente estudo ou concluí [formação] em [ano real ou previsto]. Desde então, [atividade real]."},{"title":"Seu financiamento","summary":"Explique quem paga e quais despesas estão cobertas.","intro":"Podem perguntar como você pagará os estudos e as despesas de vida.","structure":"Apresente as fontes, valores confirmados, condições e despesas restantes.","points":["Confira mensalidades, moradia, alimentação e outras despesas para o mesmo período. Verifique também viagem, verão e seguro.","Se tiver bolsa, explique como a recebeu e o que a carta de concessão confirma. Não suponha que uma bolsa «integral» cubra tudo.","Explique quem pagará o restante, sua relação com essa pessoa e a origem do dinheiro. Confira o que não sabe; não suponha contribuições iguais."],"questions":["Quem financia seus estudos?","O que o financiamento confirmado cobre e sob quais condições?","Como serão pagas as despesas restantes?"],"prompts":["Quem financia seus estudos?","O que o financiamento confirmado cobre e sob quais condições?","Como serão pagas as despesas restantes?"],"example":"[Fonte real] pagará [despesas confirmadas]. As despesas restantes serão cobertas por [fonte confirmada]."},{"title":"Seus planos futuros","summary":"Fale sobre o que quer fazer depois dos estudos.","intro":"Relacione a formação aos seus objetivos reais.","structure":"Apresente seu objetivo, as habilidades úteis e o que ainda precisa decidir.","points":["Explique como o curso pode ajudar no trabalho ou em estudos futuros.","Diferencie acordos confirmados de aspirações. Algumas decisões podem continuar em aberto.","Não invente oferta de emprego, obrigação familiar ou promessa de retorno. Mencione o esporte apenas se fizer parte real dos seus planos."],"questions":["O que quer fazer depois dos estudos?","Como esse curso vai ajudar?","O que está confirmado e o que ainda está considerando?"],"prompts":["O que quer fazer depois dos estudos?","Como esse curso vai ajudar?","O que está confirmado e o que ainda está considerando?"],"example":"Depois dos estudos, quero [objetivo real]. Esse curso me ajudará a desenvolver [habilidades úteis]."},{"title":"Suas circunstâncias","summary":"Fale sobre solicitações anteriores e mudanças relevantes.","intro":"Pratique apenas os assuntos que se aplicam a você.","structure":"Explique o que aconteceu, o que mudou e o que está confirmado agora.","points":["Se recebeu uma recusa, explique os fatos e eventuais mudanças. Uma instituição ou documento novo não garante aprovação.","Se mudou de instituição ou de data de início, explique por quê e confirme os novos acordos com a instituição.","Se pratica esporte, explique seu recrutamento, resultados e como conciliará estudo e esporte. Não invente compromissos confirmados."],"questions":["Já apresentou uma solicitação? O que mudou?","Sua instituição ou data de início mudou?","Se pratica esporte, como foi recrutado?"],"prompts":["Já apresentou uma solicitação? O que mudou?","Sua instituição ou data de início mudou?","Se pratica esporte, como foi recrutado?"],"example":"[Situação real]. O que mudou: [mudança, se houver]. Os acordos confirmados são [fatos]."},{"title":"Prática de entrevista","summary":"Pratique respostas curtas antes da entrevista simulada.","intro":"As perguntas podem aparecer em outra ordem.","structure":"Responda à pergunta, acrescente um detalhe útil e faça uma pausa.","points":["Ouça com atenção. Use suas próprias palavras em vez de um discurso decorado.","Pratique estudos, financiamento e planos futuros. Mantenha os mesmos fatos mesmo quando a pergunta mudar.","Peça para repetir ou explicar quando necessário. Diga quando não souber um detalhe. Use o relatório para escolher a próxima prática."],"questions":["Quais perguntas consegue responder com clareza?","O que ainda precisa conferir ou praticar?","O que quer melhorar na entrevista simulada?"],"prompts":["Quais perguntas consegue responder com clareza?","O que ainda precisa conferir ou praticar?","O que quer melhorar na entrevista simulada?"],"example":"Escolhi [instituição] porque [razão real]. Verifiquei [detalhe relevante]."}],"levels":{"high-school":"Para o ensino médio, fale da série atual e das matérias. Não suponha que já terminou. Verifique moradia e apoio de um adulto ou da escola. Não precisa já ter escolhido profissão ou curso universitário.","undergraduate":"Para graduação, explique o ensino médio, estudos superiores e transferências ou pausas reais. Diferencie o nível que planeja iniciar da sua situação atual.","masters":"Para mestrado, relacione a formação anterior e a experiência com o curso. Confira as condições reais de bolsas ou funções de assistente.","phd":"Para doutorado, explique a pesquisa com simplicidade. Diferencie um possível orientador de um acordo confirmado. Não suponha financiamento integral; confira duração, condições e despesas restantes."},"strings":{"Your learning path":"Seu caminho de aprendizagem","Your students’ learning":"A aprendizagem dos seus alunos","Continue your preparation for your F-1 interview.":"Continue sua preparação para a entrevista F-1.","Learn in your language":"Aprenda no seu idioma","Learning language":"Idioma de aprendizagem","Choose the language for lessons and your voice tutor. Mock interview language is separate.":"Escolha o idioma das lições e do tutor de voz. O idioma da entrevista é separado.","Choose before starting a session. Your notes stay in the language you wrote them.":"Escolha antes de começar. Suas notas ficam no idioma em que foram escritas.","Choose a module":"Escolha um módulo","Completion tracks your learning, not visa approval or interview readiness.":"A conclusão registra aprendizagem, não aprovação de visto nem prontidão para a entrevista.","← Back to all modules":"← Todos os módulos","1. Learn":"1. Aprender","Understand the question":"Entenda a pergunta","How to answer":"Como responder","See an example":"Veja um exemplo","Use your actual facts. Note anything you still need to check.":"Use seus fatos reais. Anote o que precisa conferir.","2. Practise with your tutor":"2. Pratique com seu tutor","Your tutor explains, gives an example, and helps you practise in your own words. Ask “explain more” if you need help, or say “next” to move on.":"O tutor explica, dá um exemplo e ajuda você a praticar com suas palavras. Peça «explique mais» ou diga «próximo» para continuar.","Ready to start":"Pronto para começar","Start voice lesson":"Iniciar lição de voz","End lesson conversation":"Encerrar conversa","Voice lessons last up to 8 minutes. Daily practice attempts are unlimited. Reading and notes remain available.":"As lições de voz duram até 8 minutos. As tentativas diárias são ilimitadas. A leitura e as notas continuam disponíveis.","Your conversation is for learning, with no readiness score. Save the points you want to keep in your notes; the conversation itself is not saved.":"Esta conversa é para aprender, sem pontuação. Guarde os pontos úteis nas notas; a conversa não é salva.","My notes — optional":"Minhas notas — opcional","You do not need to write anything to finish. Your saved notes stay here if you want to use them.":"Não é preciso escrever para concluir. Suas notas salvas ficam aqui.","Questions you can practise aloud or write about:":"Perguntas para praticar falando ou escrevendo:","Anything you want to remember":"O que quiser lembrar","Save notes":"Salvar notas","3. Finish this module":"3. Conclua este módulo","By completing this module, you confirm that you reviewed it and practised an answer. You can practise with the tutor or on your own.":"Ao concluir, confirma que revisou o módulo e praticou uma resposta, com o tutor ou sozinho.","Complete module & continue →":"Concluir e continuar →","Complete module & go to mock interview →":"Concluir e ir à entrevista →","Retry loading lesson":"Tentar carregar novamente","Completion records your progress through this lesson, not an assessment of readiness. You can revisit it any time.":"Concluir registra progresso, não uma avaliação de prontidão. Pode voltar quando quiser.","Completed":"Concluído","In progress":"Em andamento","Not started":"Não iniciado","Not completed":"Não concluído","Module":"Módulo","Review your course":"Revisar o curso","Continue lesson":"Continuar lição","Use your actual facts; note anything you need to check.":"Use seus fatos reais; anote o que precisa conferir.","This is an example template, not a statement about you. Replace brackets with confirmed facts; do not memorize it.":"É um modelo, não uma afirmação sobre você. Substitua os colchetes por fatos confirmados; não decore.","Unsaved changes":"Alterações não salvas","Loading your notes…":"Carregando notas…","Saving…":"Salvando…","Notes saved. You can return to them later.":"Notas salvas. Pode voltar depois.","Earlier notes saved. You have new unsaved changes.":"Notas anteriores salvas. Há novas alterações não salvas.","Lesson complete. You can keep practising or try a mock interview.":"Lição concluída. Continue praticando ou tente uma entrevista.","Unlimited tutoring starts. Session time limits still apply.":"Inícios de tutoria ilimitados. O limite por sessão continua válido.","Up to 8 minutes. Voice stops automatically at the limit.":"Até 8 minutos. A voz para automaticamente no limite.","Your tutor is responding…":"Seu tutor está respondendo…","Focus first":"Prioridade","Your next steps":"Seus próximos passos","More next steps":"Mais passos","What went well":"O que foi bem","Points to clarify":"Pontos a esclarecer","There is not enough evidence in this interview to identify a clear strength yet.":"Ainda não há evidências suficientes para identificar um ponto forte.","No specific improvement identified in the answers assessed.":"Não foi identificada melhoria específica nas respostas avaliadas.","No specific weakness identified from the answers assessed.":"Não foi identificado ponto fraco específico nas respostas avaliadas.","Interview feedback":"Feedback da entrevista","Next step":"Próximo passo","What to work on next":"O que praticar depois","Practise this":"Praticar isto","How your score was calculated":"Como sua pontuação foi calculada","Overall preparation":"Preparação geral","Partial practice score":"Pontuação parcial de prática","Practice readiness":"Prontidão para a prática","Practice score":"Pontuação de prática","Practice preparation score":"Pontuação de preparação","Interview incomplete":"Entrevista incompleta","Partial interview · assessed answers only":"Entrevista parcial · apenas respostas avaliadas","Not enough information to score":"Informações insuficientes para pontuar","Feedback on this practice interview, not a prediction of visa approval.":"Feedback desta prática, não uma previsão de aprovação de visto.","Practice feedback only. This is not a prediction or guarantee of visa approval.":"Apenas feedback de prática. Não prevê nem garante aprovação de visto.","Interview coverage":"Cobertura da entrevista","Partial interview · keep practising the remaining areas":"Entrevista parcial · pratique as áreas restantes","Not assessed — no points earned yet":"Não avaliado — ainda sem pontos","Not covered — not counted against you":"Não abordado — sem penalização","All relevant main areas were covered.":"Todas as áreas principais relevantes foram abordadas.","Not assessed":"Não avaliado","Assessed":"Avaliado","Not scored":"Sem pontuação","Ready":"Pronto","Almost Ready":"Quase pronto","Needs Significant Prep":"Precisa de bastante preparação","High Concern":"Pontos importantes a melhorar","Standard":"Padrão","Challenging":"Desafiador","Intensive":"Intensivo","Study plans":"Planos de estudo","School choice":"Escolha da instituição","Your subject":"Sua área","Academic history":"Histórico acadêmico","Funding":"Financiamento","Future plans":"Planos futuros","Previous applications and travel":"Solicitações e viagens anteriores","Print / save report as PDF":"Imprimir / salvar relatório PDF","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimir / salvar PDF","Download report (PDF)":"Baixar relatório (PDF)","Opens a print-ready report. Choose Save as PDF in your browser.":"Abre um relatório para impressão. Escolha Salvar como PDF no navegador.","F-1 INTERVIEW PRACTICE REPORT":"RELATÓRIO DE PRÁTICA DE ENTREVISTA F-1","Topic coverage and scores":"Temas e pontuações","Scoring basis":"Base da pontuação","Not assessed means no points earned yet; it does not mean a wrong answer.":"Não avaliado significa ainda sem pontos, não uma resposta errada.","Each assessed topic is scored out of 10. The average is converted to a score out of 100. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Cada tema avaliado recebe nota de 0 a 10. A média é convertida para 100. Temas sem resposta são excluídos.","At least two distinct substantive answers are needed for a score. Feedback is still available.":"São necessárias pelo menos duas respostas substanciais distintas para pontuar. O feedback continua disponível.","All seven areas were assessed.":"As sete áreas foram avaliadas.","Interview incomplete. Unassessed areas earn no points yet; this does not mean their answers were wrong.":"Entrevista incompleta. Áreas não avaliadas ainda não somam pontos; isso não significa respostas erradas.","Try another mock to cover the topics listed below.":"Tente outra entrevista para abordar os temas abaixo.","Keep practising clear answers in your own words.":"Continue praticando respostas claras com suas palavras.","Human review":"Revisão humana","Add human review":"Adicionar revisão humana","Student":"Estudante","Not recorded":"Não registrado","Mode not recorded":"Modo não registrado","No written feedback was recorded.":"Nenhum feedback escrito registrado.","Detailed topic assessments were not recorded for this historical report.":"Este relatório antigo não tem avaliações detalhadas registradas.","Private practice feedback":"Feedback privado de prática","Choose Save as PDF in the print dialog. On iPhone, use Share → Print to preview and save the report.":"Escolha Salvar como PDF na impressão. No iPhone, use Compartilhar → Imprimir para visualizar e salvar.","Scoring basis: assessed topic scores only. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Somente temas avaliados são pontuados. Temas sem resposta são excluídos.","Assessed topic scores only; unanswered topics are excluded.":"Apenas temas avaliados; os sem resposta são excluídos.","Assessed - score not recorded":"Avaliado — pontuação não registrada","Focused practice":"Prática focada","Review this feedback with your tutor. Starting this lesson does not mark the issue as resolved.":"Revise este feedback com o tutor. Começar não marca o ponto como resolvido.","Return to regular lesson":"Voltar à lição","A student profile is needed to save notes or start a lesson.":"É necessário um perfil para salvar notas ou começar.","An answer, a useful point, or something to check later.":"Uma resposta, um ponto útil ou algo para conferir depois.","Requesting microphone…":"Solicitando microfone…","Listening — answer when you’re ready.":"Ouvindo — responda quando estiver pronto.","One minute remaining in this voice session.":"Resta um minuto.","Switch modules without saving these notes?":"Mudar sem salvar as notas?","Return to modules without saving your changes?":"Voltar sem salvar as alterações?","Switch students without saving these notes?":"Mudar de aluno sem salvar?"},"formats":{"progress":"{0} de {1} módulos concluídos","module":"Módulo {0} de {1}","coverage":"{0} de {1} áreas avaliadas","score":"{0} pontos de {1} nas sete áreas, convertidos para pontuação de 0 a 100.","quality":"Qualidade dos temas respondidos: {0}/100. Média apenas das áreas avaliadas.","date":"Data da prática: {0}","mock":"Entrevista n.º {0}","adjusted":"Pontuação ajustada: {0}/100","reviewer":"Avaliador: {0}"}},"ar":{"lessons":[{"title":"خططك الدراسية","summary":"اشرح ما تريد دراسته ولماذا.","intro":"قد تُسأل عن سبب اختيار الولايات المتحدة أو المؤسسة التعليمية أو البرنامج.","structure":"اذكر ما ستدرسه وأين، ثم أضف سببًا شخصيًا محددًا.","points":["اشرح اهتمامك بالمجال من خلال مادة دراسية أو تجربة أو شيء تريد تعلمه.","اذكر سببًا حقيقيًا لاختيار الولايات المتحدة بناءً على معلومات تحققت منها عن البرنامج.","اذكر مادة أو مشروعًا أو ميزة تحققت منها في المؤسسة. قارن فقط بالمؤسسات التي فكرت فيها فعلًا."],"questions":["لماذا يهمك هذا المجال؟","لماذا هذه المؤسسة والولايات المتحدة؟","ماذا تريد أن تتعلم؟"],"prompts":["لماذا يهمك هذا المجال؟","لماذا هذه المؤسسة والولايات المتحدة؟","ماذا تريد أن تتعلم؟"],"example":"أريد دراسة [المجال] في [المؤسسة] لأن [سبب حقيقي]."},{"title":"مسيرتك الدراسية","summary":"تحدث عن دراستك وما فعلته بعدها.","intro":"تتناول هذه الأسئلة تعليمك وسبب رغبتك في مواصلة الدراسة.","structure":"اذكر دراستك وتواريخها وأنشطتك التالية ونتائجك الحقيقية.","points":["كن صادقًا بشأن درجاتك، واشرح أي انقطاع أو تغيير في المؤسسة التعليمية.","للماجستير أو الدكتوراه، اربط دراستك أو عملك أو أبحاثك بالبرنامج الجديد. اشرح تغيير المجال بصدق.","ميّز بين الدراسة المكتملة والجارية. موعد التخرج المتوقع لا يعني حصولك على المؤهل بالفعل."],"questions":["ماذا تدرس أو درست، ومتى؟","ماذا فعلت منذ ذلك الوقت، أو ماذا تفعل الآن؟","لماذا تريد الالتحاق بهذا البرنامج الآن؟"],"prompts":["ماذا تدرس أو درست، ومتى؟","ماذا فعلت منذ ذلك الوقت، أو ماذا تفعل الآن؟","لماذا تريد الالتحاق بهذا البرنامج الآن؟"],"example":"أدرس حاليًا أو أنهيت [الدراسة] في [سنة فعلية أو متوقعة]. ومنذ ذلك الوقت، [نشاط حقيقي]."},{"title":"تمويل دراستك","summary":"اشرح من يدفع وما النفقات التي يغطيها.","intro":"قد تُسأل عن كيفية دفع تكاليف الدراسة والمعيشة.","structure":"اذكر مصادر التمويل والمبالغ المؤكدة والشروط والتكاليف المتبقية.","points":["تحقق من الرسوم والسكن والطعام والنفقات الأخرى للفترة نفسها. تحقق أيضًا من السفر والصيف والتأمين.","إذا كانت لديك منحة، اشرح كيف حصلت عليها وما يؤكده خطاب المنحة. لا تفترض أن المنحة «الكاملة» تغطي كل شيء.","اشرح من سيدفع الباقي وعلاقتك به ومصدر المال. تحقق مما لا تعرفه، ولا تفترض تساوي المساهمات."],"questions":["من يمول دراستك؟","ما الذي يغطيه التمويل المؤكد وما شروطه؟","كيف ستُدفع التكاليف المتبقية؟"],"prompts":["من يمول دراستك؟","ما الذي يغطيه التمويل المؤكد وما شروطه؟","كيف ستُدفع التكاليف المتبقية؟"],"example":"سيدفع [المصدر الحقيقي] تكاليف [النفقات المؤكدة]. وسيغطي [مصدر مؤكد] التكاليف المتبقية."},{"title":"خططك المستقبلية","summary":"تحدث عما تريد فعله بعد الدراسة.","intro":"اربط دراستك بأهدافك الحقيقية.","structure":"اذكر هدفك والمهارات المفيدة وما لم تقرره بعد.","points":["اشرح كيف قد يساعدك البرنامج في عملك أو دراستك المستقبلية.","ميّز بين الترتيبات المؤكدة والأمور التي تأمل تحقيقها. لا بأس إذا بقيت بعض القرارات مفتوحة.","لا تختلق عرض عمل أو التزامًا عائليًا أو وعدًا بالعودة. اذكر الرياضة فقط إذا كانت جزءًا حقيقيًا من خططك."],"questions":["ماذا تريد أن تفعل بعد الدراسة؟","كيف سيساعدك هذا البرنامج؟","ما المؤكد وما الذي لا تزال تفكر فيه؟"],"prompts":["ماذا تريد أن تفعل بعد الدراسة؟","كيف سيساعدك هذا البرنامج؟","ما المؤكد وما الذي لا تزال تفكر فيه؟"],"example":"بعد الدراسة، أريد [هدف حقيقي]. سيساعدني البرنامج على تطوير [مهارات مفيدة]."},{"title":"ظروفك الخاصة","summary":"تحدث عن الطلبات السابقة والتغييرات ذات الصلة.","intro":"تدرّب فقط على الموضوعات التي تنطبق عليك.","structure":"اشرح ما حدث وما تغير وما هو مؤكد الآن.","points":["إذا رُفض طلبك سابقًا، اشرح الوقائع وأي تغييرات. المؤسسة أو الوثيقة الجديدة لا تضمن الموافقة.","إذا تغيرت المؤسسة أو موعد البدء، اشرح السبب وتحقق من الترتيبات الجديدة مع المؤسسة.","إذا كنت تمارس الرياضة، اشرح استقطابك ونتائجك وكيف ستجمع بين الدراسة والرياضة. لا تختلق التزامات مؤكدة."],"questions":["هل قدمت طلبًا سابقًا؟ وما الذي تغير؟","هل تغيرت المؤسسة أو موعد البدء؟","إذا كنت تمارس الرياضة، كيف جرى استقطابك؟"],"prompts":["هل قدمت طلبًا سابقًا؟ وما الذي تغير؟","هل تغيرت المؤسسة أو موعد البدء؟","إذا كنت تمارس الرياضة، كيف جرى استقطابك؟"],"example":"[الوضع الحقيقي]. ما تغير: [تغيير إن وجد]. والترتيبات المؤكدة هي [حقائق]."},{"title":"التدرب على المقابلة","summary":"تدرّب على إجابات قصيرة قبل المقابلة التجريبية.","intro":"قد تأتي الأسئلة بترتيب مختلف.","structure":"أجب عن السؤال، وأضف تفصيلًا مفيدًا، ثم توقف قليلًا.","points":["استمع بانتباه. استخدم كلماتك بدلًا من خطاب محفوظ.","تدرّب على الدراسة والتمويل والخطط المستقبلية. حافظ على الحقائق نفسها حتى إذا تغيرت صياغة السؤال.","اطلب التكرار أو التوضيح عند الحاجة. قل إنك لا تعرف إذا غاب عنك تفصيل. استخدم التقرير لاختيار التدريب التالي."],"questions":["ما الأسئلة التي تستطيع الإجابة عنها بوضوح؟","ما الذي ما زلت تحتاج إلى التحقق منه أو التدرب عليه؟","ما الذي تريد تحسينه في المقابلة التجريبية؟"],"prompts":["ما الأسئلة التي تستطيع الإجابة عنها بوضوح؟","ما الذي ما زلت تحتاج إلى التحقق منه أو التدرب عليه؟","ما الذي تريد تحسينه في المقابلة التجريبية؟"],"example":"اخترت [المؤسسة] لأن [سبب حقيقي]. وقد تحققت من [تفصيل ذي صلة]."}],"levels":{"high-school":"للمرحلة الثانوية، تحدث عن صفك الحالي وموادك. لا تفترض أنك أكملت الدراسة. تحقق من السكن ودعم شخص بالغ أو المؤسسة. ليس مطلوبًا أن تكون قد اخترت مهنة أو تخصصًا جامعيًا.","undergraduate":"للبكالوريوس، اشرح تعليمك الثانوي وأي دراسة جامعية وانتقالات أو انقطاعات فعلية. ميّز بين المستوى الذي تنوي بدءه ووضعك الحالي.","masters":"للماجستير، اربط مؤهلك السابق وخبرتك بالبرنامج. تحقق من الشروط الفعلية للمنح أو وظائف المساعدة.","phd":"للدكتوراه، اشرح بحثك ببساطة. ميّز بين مشرف تأمل العمل معه واتفاق مؤكد. لا تفترض التمويل الكامل؛ تحقق من مدته وشروطه والتكاليف المتبقية."},"strings":{"Your learning path":"مسارك التعليمي","Your students’ learning":"تعلم طلابك","Continue your preparation for your F-1 interview.":"واصل الاستعداد لمقابلة F-1.","Learn in your language":"تعلّم بلغتك","Learning language":"لغة التعلم","Choose the language for lessons and your voice tutor. Mock interview language is separate.":"اختر لغة الدروس والمعلم الصوتي. لغة المقابلة مستقلة.","Choose before starting a session. Your notes stay in the language you wrote them.":"اختر قبل بدء الجلسة. تبقى ملاحظاتك باللغة التي كتبتها بها.","Choose a module":"اختر وحدة","Completion tracks your learning, not visa approval or interview readiness.":"الإكمال يسجل تعلمك، وليس الموافقة على التأشيرة أو جاهزيتك للمقابلة.","← Back to all modules":"← جميع الوحدات","1. Learn":"1. تعلّم","Understand the question":"افهم السؤال","How to answer":"كيف تجيب","See an example":"شاهد مثالًا","Use your actual facts. Note anything you still need to check.":"استخدم حقائقك الفعلية. دوّن ما تحتاج إلى التحقق منه.","2. Practise with your tutor":"2. تدرّب مع معلمك","Your tutor explains, gives an example, and helps you practise in your own words. Ask “explain more” if you need help, or say “next” to move on.":"يشرح المعلم ويقدم مثالًا ويساعدك على التدرب بكلماتك. اطلب «اشرح أكثر» أو قل «التالي» للمتابعة.","Ready to start":"جاهز للبدء","Start voice lesson":"ابدأ الدرس الصوتي","End lesson conversation":"إنهاء المحادثة","Voice lessons last up to 8 minutes. Daily practice attempts are unlimited. Reading and notes remain available.":"مدة الدرس الصوتي حتى 8 دقائق. المحاولات اليومية غير محدودة. تبقى القراءة والملاحظات متاحة.","Your conversation is for learning, with no readiness score. Save the points you want to keep in your notes; the conversation itself is not saved.":"هذه المحادثة للتعلم دون درجة جاهزية. احفظ النقاط المفيدة في ملاحظاتك؛ المحادثة نفسها لا تُحفظ.","My notes — optional":"ملاحظاتي — اختياري","You do not need to write anything to finish. Your saved notes stay here if you want to use them.":"لا يلزم أن تكتب لإكمال الدرس. تبقى ملاحظاتك المحفوظة هنا.","Questions you can practise aloud or write about:":"أسئلة للتدرب شفهيًا أو كتابيًا:","Anything you want to remember":"أي شيء تريد تذكره","Save notes":"حفظ الملاحظات","3. Finish this module":"3. أكمل الوحدة","By completing this module, you confirm that you reviewed it and practised an answer. You can practise with the tutor or on your own.":"بإكمال الوحدة تؤكد مراجعتها والتدرب على إجابة، مع المعلم أو بمفردك.","Complete module & continue →":"أكمل وتابع →","Complete module & go to mock interview →":"أكمل وانتقل للمقابلة →","Retry loading lesson":"أعد تحميل الدرس","Completion records your progress through this lesson, not an assessment of readiness. You can revisit it any time.":"الإكمال يسجل تقدمك ولا يقيّم جاهزيتك. يمكنك العودة في أي وقت.","Completed":"مكتمل","In progress":"قيد التقدم","Not started":"لم يبدأ","Not completed":"غير مكتمل","Module":"الوحدة","Review your course":"راجع الدروس","Continue lesson":"تابع الدرس","Use your actual facts; note anything you need to check.":"استخدم حقائقك ودوّن ما تحتاج للتحقق منه.","This is an example template, not a statement about you. Replace brackets with confirmed facts; do not memorize it.":"هذا نموذج وليس وصفًا لك. استبدل الأقواس بحقائق مؤكدة ولا تحفظه حرفيًا.","Unsaved changes":"تغييرات غير محفوظة","Loading your notes…":"جارٍ تحميل ملاحظاتك…","Saving…":"جارٍ الحفظ…","Notes saved. You can return to them later.":"حُفظت الملاحظات. يمكنك العودة إليها لاحقًا.","Earlier notes saved. You have new unsaved changes.":"حُفظت الملاحظات السابقة. توجد تغييرات جديدة غير محفوظة.","Lesson complete. You can keep practising or try a mock interview.":"اكتمل الدرس. واصل التدريب أو جرّب مقابلة.","Unlimited tutoring starts. Session time limits still apply.":"بدء الدروس غير محدود. تظل مدة الجلسة محدودة.","Up to 8 minutes. Voice stops automatically at the limit.":"حتى 8 دقائق. يتوقف الصوت تلقائيًا عند الحد.","Your tutor is responding…":"المعلم يرد…","Focus first":"ابدأ بهذا","Your next steps":"خطواتك التالية","More next steps":"خطوات أخرى","What went well":"ما سار جيدًا","Points to clarify":"نقاط تحتاج إلى توضيح","There is not enough evidence in this interview to identify a clear strength yet.":"لا توجد أدلة كافية في هذه المقابلة لتحديد نقطة قوة واضحة بعد.","No specific improvement identified in the answers assessed.":"لم يُحدد تحسين معين في الإجابات المقيّمة.","No specific weakness identified from the answers assessed.":"لم تُحدد نقطة ضعف معينة في الإجابات المقيّمة.","Interview feedback":"ملاحظات المقابلة","Next step":"الخطوة التالية","What to work on next":"ما تتدرب عليه بعد ذلك","Practise this":"تدرّب على هذا","How your score was calculated":"كيف حُسبت درجتك","Overall preparation":"الاستعداد العام","Partial practice score":"درجة تدريب جزئية","Practice readiness":"الجاهزية للتدريب","Practice score":"درجة التدريب","Practice preparation score":"درجة الاستعداد للتدريب","Interview incomplete":"المقابلة غير مكتملة","Partial interview · assessed answers only":"مقابلة جزئية · الإجابات المقيّمة فقط","Not enough information to score":"معلومات غير كافية للتقييم","Feedback on this practice interview, not a prediction of visa approval.":"ملاحظات على هذا التدريب وليست توقعًا للموافقة على التأشيرة.","Practice feedback only. This is not a prediction or guarantee of visa approval.":"ملاحظات تدريبية فقط، وليست توقعًا أو ضمانًا للموافقة على التأشيرة.","Interview coverage":"تغطية موضوعات المقابلة","Partial interview · keep practising the remaining areas":"مقابلة جزئية · واصل التدرب على الموضوعات المتبقية","Not assessed — no points earned yet":"لم يُقيّم — لا نقاط مكتسبة بعد","Not covered — not counted against you":"لم يُغطّ — لا يُحسب ضدك","All relevant main areas were covered.":"تمت تغطية جميع الموضوعات الرئيسية ذات الصلة.","Not assessed":"لم يُقيّم","Assessed":"تم التقييم","Not scored":"دون درجة","Ready":"جاهز","Almost Ready":"شبه جاهز","Needs Significant Prep":"يحتاج إلى إعداد كبير","High Concern":"نقاط مهمة تحتاج إلى تحسين","Standard":"عادي","Challenging":"متقدم","Intensive":"مكثف","Study plans":"الخطط الدراسية","School choice":"اختيار المؤسسة","Your subject":"مجالك الدراسي","Academic history":"التاريخ الدراسي","Funding":"التمويل","Future plans":"الخطط المستقبلية","Previous applications and travel":"الطلبات والسفر السابقان","Print / save report as PDF":"طباعة التقرير أو حفظه PDF","Print / save as PDF":"طباعة أو حفظ PDF","Download report (PDF)":"تنزيل التقرير (PDF)","Opens a print-ready report. Choose Save as PDF in your browser.":"يفتح تقريرًا للطباعة. اختر الحفظ بصيغة PDF في المتصفح.","F-1 INTERVIEW PRACTICE REPORT":"تقرير التدريب على مقابلة F-1","Topic coverage and scores":"الموضوعات والدرجات","Scoring basis":"أساس احتساب الدرجة","Not assessed means no points earned yet; it does not mean a wrong answer.":"عدم التقييم يعني عدم اكتساب نقاط بعد، وليس أن الإجابة خاطئة.","Each assessed topic is scored out of 10. The average is converted to a score out of 100. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"كل موضوع مقيّم درجته من 10. يُحوّل المتوسط إلى 100. تُستثنى الموضوعات غير المجاب عنها.","At least two distinct substantive answers are needed for a score. Feedback is still available.":"يلزم تقديم إجابتين مختلفتين ذواتي مضمون على الأقل لاحتساب درجة. تظل الملاحظات متاحة.","All seven areas were assessed.":"تم تقييم الموضوعات السبعة.","Interview incomplete. Unassessed areas earn no points yet; this does not mean their answers were wrong.":"المقابلة غير مكتملة. الموضوعات غير المقيّمة لم تكتسب نقاطًا بعد؛ هذا لا يعني أن إجاباتها خاطئة.","Try another mock to cover the topics listed below.":"جرّب مقابلة أخرى لتغطية الموضوعات التالية.","Keep practising clear answers in your own words.":"واصل التدرب على إجابات واضحة بكلماتك.","Human review":"مراجعة بشرية","Add human review":"إضافة مراجعة بشرية","Student":"الطالب","Not recorded":"غير مسجل","Mode not recorded":"النمط غير مسجل","No written feedback was recorded.":"لم تُسجل ملاحظات مكتوبة.","Detailed topic assessments were not recorded for this historical report.":"لم تُسجل تقييمات تفصيلية لهذا التقرير القديم.","Private practice feedback":"ملاحظات تدريبية خاصة","Choose Save as PDF in the print dialog. On iPhone, use Share → Print to preview and save the report.":"اختر الحفظ بصيغة PDF في نافذة الطباعة. على iPhone استخدم مشاركة ← طباعة للمعاينة والحفظ.","Scoring basis: assessed topic scores only. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"تُحتسب درجات الموضوعات المقيّمة فقط. تُستثنى الموضوعات غير المجاب عنها.","Assessed topic scores only; unanswered topics are excluded.":"الموضوعات المقيّمة فقط؛ تُستثنى غير المجاب عنها.","Assessed - score not recorded":"تم التقييم — الدرجة غير مسجلة","Focused practice":"تدريب مركّز","Review this feedback with your tutor. Starting this lesson does not mark the issue as resolved.":"راجع هذه الملاحظات مع المعلم. بدء الدرس لا يعني حل المشكلة.","Return to regular lesson":"العودة للدرس العادي","A student profile is needed to save notes or start a lesson.":"يلزم ملف طالب لحفظ الملاحظات أو بدء الدرس.","An answer, a useful point, or something to check later.":"إجابة أو نقطة مفيدة أو شيء للتحقق منه لاحقًا.","Requesting microphone…":"جارٍ طلب الميكروفون…","Listening — answer when you’re ready.":"أستمع — أجب عندما تكون مستعدًا.","One minute remaining in this voice session.":"تبقت دقيقة واحدة.","Switch modules without saving these notes?":"تغيير الوحدة دون حفظ الملاحظات؟","Return to modules without saving your changes?":"العودة دون حفظ التغييرات؟","Switch students without saving these notes?":"تغيير الطالب دون حفظ الملاحظات؟"},"formats":{"progress":"اكتملت {0} من {1} وحدات","module":"الوحدة {0} من {1}","coverage":"تم تقييم {0} من {1} موضوعات","score":"{0} نقاط من {1} عبر الموضوعات السبعة، محوّلة إلى درجة من 100.","quality":"جودة الموضوعات المجاب عنها: {0}/100. متوسط الموضوعات المقيّمة فقط.","date":"تاريخ التدريب: {0}","mock":"المقابلة التجريبية رقم {0}","adjusted":"الدرجة المعدّلة: {0}/100","reviewer":"المراجع: {0}"}},"sw":{"lessons":[{"title":"Mipango yako ya masomo","summary":"Eleza unachotaka kusoma na sababu zako.","intro":"Unaweza kuulizwa kwa nini ulichagua Marekani, shule au programu hii.","structure":"Sema utakachosoma na mahali, kisha ongeza sababu yako halisi na maalum.","points":["Eleza unachopenda kuhusu somo kwa kutumia darasa, uzoefu au kitu unachotaka kujifunza.","Toa sababu halisi ya kuchagua Marekani kulingana na ulichohakikisha kuhusu programu.","Taja kozi, mradi au sifa ya shule uliyoihakikisha. Linganisha shule ulizozifikiria kweli tu."],"questions":["Kwa nini somo hili linakuvutia?","Kwa nini shule hii na Marekani?","Ungependa kujifunza nini?"],"prompts":["Kwa nini somo hili linakuvutia?","Kwa nini shule hii na Marekani?","Ungependa kujifunza nini?"],"example":"Nataka kusoma [somo] katika [shule] kwa sababu [sababu halisi]."},{"title":"Historia yako ya masomo","summary":"Eleza masomo yako na ulichofanya tangu wakati huo.","intro":"Maswali haya yanahusu elimu yako na sababu ya kuendelea kusoma.","structure":"Eleza masomo, tarehe na shughuli zilizofuata kwa kutumia matokeo yako halisi.","points":["Kuwa mkweli kuhusu alama zako na eleza mapumziko au mabadiliko ya shule.","Kwa uzamili au uzamivu, unganisha masomo, kazi au utafiti wako na programu mpya. Eleza kwa ukweli mabadiliko ya taaluma.","Tofautisha masomo yaliyokamilika na yanayoendelea. Tarehe inayotarajiwa ya kumaliza haimaanishi tayari umepata sifa hiyo."],"questions":["Unasoma au ulisoma nini, na lini?","Umefanya nini tangu wakati huo au unafanya nini sasa?","Kwa nini unataka kusoma programu hii sasa?"],"prompts":["Unasoma au ulisoma nini, na lini?","Umefanya nini tangu wakati huo au unafanya nini sasa?","Kwa nini unataka kusoma programu hii sasa?"],"example":"Ninasoma sasa au nilimaliza [masomo] mwaka [halisi au unaotarajiwa]. Tangu hapo, [shughuli halisi]."},{"title":"Ufadhili wako","summary":"Eleza anayelipa na gharama zinazolipiwa.","intro":"Unaweza kuulizwa jinsi utakavyolipia masomo na maisha.","structure":"Taja vyanzo, kiasi kilichothibitishwa, masharti na gharama zilizobaki.","points":["Hakikisha ada, makazi, chakula na gharama nyingine kwa kipindi kilekile. Kagua pia usafiri, majira ya joto na bima.","Ikiwa una ufadhili wa masomo, eleza ulivyoupata na yaliyothibitishwa kwenye barua. Usidhani ufadhili «kamili» unalipia kila kitu.","Eleza anayelipa kilichobaki, uhusiano wenu na chanzo cha pesa. Hakikisha usiyoyajua; usidhani michango ni sawa."],"questions":["Nani anafadhili masomo yako?","Ufadhili uliothibitishwa unalipia nini na kwa masharti gani?","Gharama zilizobaki zitalipwaje?"],"prompts":["Nani anafadhili masomo yako?","Ufadhili uliothibitishwa unalipia nini na kwa masharti gani?","Gharama zilizobaki zitalipwaje?"],"example":"[Chanzo halisi] kitalipia [gharama zilizothibitishwa]. Gharama zilizobaki zitalipwa na [chanzo kilichothibitishwa]."},{"title":"Mipango yako ya baadaye","summary":"Eleza unachotaka kufanya baada ya masomo.","intro":"Unganisha masomo yako na malengo yako halisi.","structure":"Taja lengo lako, ujuzi utakaosaidia na mambo ambayo bado hujaamua.","points":["Eleza jinsi programu itakavyosaidia kazi au masomo ya baadaye.","Tofautisha mipango iliyothibitishwa na matumaini. Ni sawa ikiwa maamuzi mengine bado yako wazi.","Usibuni ofa ya kazi, wajibu wa familia au ahadi ya kurudi nyumbani. Taja michezo tu ikiwa ni sehemu halisi ya mipango yako."],"questions":["Unataka kufanya nini baada ya masomo?","Programu hii itakusaidiaje?","Nini kimethibitishwa na bado unafikiria nini?"],"prompts":["Unataka kufanya nini baada ya masomo?","Programu hii itakusaidiaje?","Nini kimethibitishwa na bado unafikiria nini?"],"example":"Baada ya masomo, nataka [lengo halisi]. Programu hii itanisaidia kupata [ujuzi muhimu]."},{"title":"Hali yako binafsi","summary":"Eleza maombi ya awali na mabadiliko yanayohusika.","intro":"Fanyia mazoezi mada zinazokuhusu tu.","structure":"Eleza kilichotokea, kilichobadilika na kilichothibitishwa sasa.","points":["Ikiwa ulikataliwa awali, eleza ukweli na mabadiliko yoyote. Shule au hati mpya haihakikishi kukubaliwa.","Ikiwa shule au tarehe ya kuanza imebadilika, eleza sababu na hakikisha mipango mipya na shule.","Ikiwa unacheza michezo, eleza ulivyochaguliwa, matokeo yako na jinsi utakavyounganisha michezo na masomo. Usibuni makubaliano yaliyothibitishwa."],"questions":["Umewahi kutuma maombi? Nini kimebadilika?","Shule au tarehe yako ya kuanza imebadilika?","Ikiwa unacheza michezo, ulichaguliwaje?"],"prompts":["Umewahi kutuma maombi? Nini kimebadilika?","Shule au tarehe yako ya kuanza imebadilika?","Ikiwa unacheza michezo, ulichaguliwaje?"],"example":"[Hali halisi]. Kilichobadilika: [mabadiliko yoyote]. Mipango iliyothibitishwa ni [ukweli]."},{"title":"Mazoezi ya mahojiano","summary":"Fanyia mazoezi majibu mafupi kabla ya mahojiano ya mazoezi.","intro":"Maswali yanaweza kuja kwa mpangilio tofauti.","structure":"Jibu swali, ongeza jambo moja muhimu, kisha tulia.","points":["Sikiliza kwa makini. Tumia maneno yako badala ya hotuba uliyokariri.","Fanyia mazoezi masomo, ufadhili na mipango ya baadaye. Tumia ukweli uleule hata swali likibadilishwa.","Omba swali lirudiwe au lielezwe inapohitajika. Sema ikiwa hujui jambo. Tumia ripoti kuchagua mazoezi yanayofuata."],"questions":["Ni maswali gani unayoweza kujibu kwa uwazi?","Bado unahitaji kuhakikisha au kufanyia mazoezi nini?","Unataka kuboresha nini kwenye mahojiano ya mazoezi?"],"prompts":["Ni maswali gani unayoweza kujibu kwa uwazi?","Bado unahitaji kuhakikisha au kufanyia mazoezi nini?","Unataka kuboresha nini kwenye mahojiano ya mazoezi?"],"example":"Nilichagua [shule] kwa sababu [sababu halisi]. Nilihakikisha [jambo husika]."}],"levels":{"high-school":"Kwa sekondari, eleza darasa na masomo yako ya sasa. Usidhani tayari umemaliza. Hakikisha makazi na msaada wa mtu mzima au shule. Si lazima uwe umechagua kazi au taaluma ya chuo bado.","undergraduate":"Kwa shahada ya kwanza, eleza elimu ya sekondari, masomo ya chuo na uhamisho au mapumziko halisi. Tofautisha kiwango unachopanga kuanza na hali yako ya sasa.","masters":"Kwa uzamili, unganisha shahada ya awali na uzoefu wako na programu. Hakikisha masharti halisi ya ufadhili au kazi ya msaidizi.","phd":"Kwa uzamivu, eleza utafiti kwa lugha rahisi. Tofautisha msimamizi unayemtazamia na makubaliano yaliyothibitishwa. Usidhani ufadhili ni kamili; hakikisha muda, masharti na gharama zilizobaki."},"strings":{"Your learning path":"Njia yako ya kujifunza","Your students’ learning":"Masomo ya wanafunzi wako","Continue your preparation for your F-1 interview.":"Endelea kujiandaa kwa mahojiano ya F-1.","Learn in your language":"Jifunze kwa lugha yako","Learning language":"Lugha ya kujifunza","Choose the language for lessons and your voice tutor. Mock interview language is separate.":"Chagua lugha ya masomo na mkufunzi wa sauti. Lugha ya mahojiano ni tofauti.","Choose before starting a session. Your notes stay in the language you wrote them.":"Chagua kabla ya kuanza. Vidokezo vyako vitabaki katika lugha uliyoviandika.","Choose a module":"Chagua moduli","Completion tracks your learning, not visa approval or interview readiness.":"Kukamilisha huonyesha kujifunza, si kukubaliwa kwa visa au utayari wa mahojiano.","← Back to all modules":"← Moduli zote","1. Learn":"1. Jifunze","Understand the question":"Elewa swali","How to answer":"Jinsi ya kujibu","See an example":"Ona mfano","Use your actual facts. Note anything you still need to check.":"Tumia ukweli wako. Andika unachohitaji kuhakikisha.","2. Practise with your tutor":"2. Fanya mazoezi na mkufunzi","Your tutor explains, gives an example, and helps you practise in your own words. Ask “explain more” if you need help, or say “next” to move on.":"Mkufunzi anaeleza, anatoa mfano na kukusaidia kwa maneno yako. Sema «eleza zaidi» au «inayofuata» kuendelea.","Ready to start":"Tayari kuanza","Start voice lesson":"Anza somo la sauti","End lesson conversation":"Maliza mazungumzo","Voice lessons last up to 8 minutes. Daily practice attempts are unlimited. Reading and notes remain available.":"Masomo ya sauti ni hadi dakika 8. Majaribio ya kila siku hayana kikomo. Kusoma na vidokezo vinabaki kupatikana.","Your conversation is for learning, with no readiness score. Save the points you want to keep in your notes; the conversation itself is not saved.":"Mazungumzo ni ya kujifunza, bila alama ya utayari. Hifadhi muhimu kwenye vidokezo; mazungumzo yenyewe hayahifadhiwi.","My notes — optional":"Vidokezo vyangu — hiari","You do not need to write anything to finish. Your saved notes stay here if you want to use them.":"Huhitaji kuandika ili kumaliza. Vidokezo ulivyohifadhi vinabaki hapa.","Questions you can practise aloud or write about:":"Maswali ya kufanya mazoezi kwa sauti au maandishi:","Anything you want to remember":"Chochote unachotaka kukumbuka","Save notes":"Hifadhi vidokezo","3. Finish this module":"3. Maliza moduli hii","By completing this module, you confirm that you reviewed it and practised an answer. You can practise with the tutor or on your own.":"Kwa kumaliza unathibitisha kuwa umepitia moduli na kufanya mazoezi ya jibu, na mkufunzi au peke yako.","Complete module & continue →":"Maliza na uendelee →","Complete module & go to mock interview →":"Maliza na uende mahojianoni →","Retry loading lesson":"Jaribu kupakia tena","Completion records your progress through this lesson, not an assessment of readiness. You can revisit it any time.":"Kukamilisha hurekodi maendeleo, si tathmini ya utayari. Unaweza kurudi wakati wowote.","Completed":"Imekamilika","In progress":"Inaendelea","Not started":"Haijaanza","Not completed":"Haijakamilika","Module":"Moduli","Review your course":"Pitia masomo","Continue lesson":"Endelea na somo","Use your actual facts; note anything you need to check.":"Tumia ukweli wako; andika unachohitaji kuhakikisha.","This is an example template, not a statement about you. Replace brackets with confirmed facts; do not memorize it.":"Huu ni mfano, si maelezo ya maisha yako. Badili mabano kwa ukweli uliothibitishwa; usikariri.","Unsaved changes":"Mabadiliko hayajahifadhiwa","Loading your notes…":"Inapakia vidokezo…","Saving…":"Inahifadhi…","Notes saved. You can return to them later.":"Vidokezo vimehifadhiwa. Unaweza kurudi baadaye.","Earlier notes saved. You have new unsaved changes.":"Vidokezo vya awali vimehifadhiwa. Mabadiliko mapya hayajahifadhiwa.","Lesson complete. You can keep practising or try a mock interview.":"Somo limekamilika. Endelea kufanya mazoezi au jaribu mahojiano.","Unlimited tutoring starts. Session time limits still apply.":"Unaweza kuanza masomo bila kikomo. Kikomo cha muda wa kila kipindi bado kinatumika.","Up to 8 minutes. Voice stops automatically at the limit.":"Hadi dakika 8. Sauti hukoma moja kwa moja muda ukiisha.","Your tutor is responding…":"Mkufunzi anajibu…","Focus first":"Anza hapa","Your next steps":"Hatua zako zinazofuata","More next steps":"Hatua zaidi","What went well":"Kilichoenda vizuri","Points to clarify":"Mambo ya kufafanua","There is not enough evidence in this interview to identify a clear strength yet.":"Bado hakuna ushahidi wa kutosha kutambua nguvu iliyo wazi katika mahojiano haya.","No specific improvement identified in the answers assessed.":"Hakuna jambo maalum la kuboresha lililotambuliwa katika majibu yaliyotathminiwa.","No specific weakness identified from the answers assessed.":"Hakuna udhaifu maalum uliotambuliwa katika majibu yaliyotathminiwa.","Interview feedback":"Maoni ya mahojiano","Next step":"Hatua inayofuata","What to work on next":"Cha kufanyia mazoezi baadaye","Practise this":"Fanyia hili mazoezi","How your score was calculated":"Jinsi alama yako ilivyohesabiwa","Overall preparation":"Maandalizi ya jumla","Partial practice score":"Alama ya mazoezi ya sehemu","Practice readiness":"Utayari wa mazoezi","Practice score":"Alama ya mazoezi","Practice preparation score":"Alama ya maandalizi","Interview incomplete":"Mahojiano hayajakamilika","Partial interview · assessed answers only":"Mahojiano ya sehemu · majibu yaliyotathminiwa tu","Not enough information to score":"Taarifa hazitoshi kutoa alama","Feedback on this practice interview, not a prediction of visa approval.":"Maoni kuhusu mazoezi haya, si utabiri wa kukubaliwa kwa visa.","Practice feedback only. This is not a prediction or guarantee of visa approval.":"Maoni ya mazoezi tu. Si utabiri wala hakikisho la kukubaliwa kwa visa.","Interview coverage":"Mada zilizoshughulikiwa","Partial interview · keep practising the remaining areas":"Mahojiano ya sehemu · endelea na mada zilizobaki","Not assessed — no points earned yet":"Haijatathminiwa — hakuna alama bado","Not covered — not counted against you":"Haijashughulikiwa — haijahesabiwa dhidi yako","All relevant main areas were covered.":"Mada zote kuu zinazohusika zimeshughulikiwa.","Not assessed":"Haijatathminiwa","Assessed":"Imetathminiwa","Not scored":"Bila alama","Ready":"Tayari","Almost Ready":"Karibu kuwa tayari","Needs Significant Prep":"Inahitaji maandalizi zaidi","High Concern":"Mambo muhimu ya kuboresha","Standard":"Kawaida","Challenging":"Yenye changamoto","Intensive":"Ya kina","Study plans":"Mipango ya masomo","School choice":"Uchaguzi wa shule","Your subject":"Somo lako","Academic history":"Historia ya masomo","Funding":"Ufadhili","Future plans":"Mipango ya baadaye","Previous applications and travel":"Maombi na safari za awali","Print / save report as PDF":"Chapisha / hifadhi ripoti PDF","Print / save as PDF":"Chapisha / hifadhi PDF","Download report (PDF)":"Pakua ripoti (PDF)","Opens a print-ready report. Choose Save as PDF in your browser.":"Hufungua ripoti ya kuchapisha. Chagua kuhifadhi PDF katika kivinjari.","F-1 INTERVIEW PRACTICE REPORT":"RIPOTI YA MAZOEZI YA MAHOJIANO YA F-1","Topic coverage and scores":"Mada na alama","Scoring basis":"Msingi wa alama","Not assessed means no points earned yet; it does not mean a wrong answer.":"Kutotathminiwa kunamaanisha hakuna alama bado, si kwamba jibu ni baya.","Each assessed topic is scored out of 10. The average is converted to a score out of 100. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Kila mada iliyotathminiwa ina alama kati ya 10. Wastani hubadilishwa kuwa kati ya 100. Mada zisizojibiwa hazijumuishwi.","At least two distinct substantive answers are needed for a score. Feedback is still available.":"Majibu mawili tofauti yenye maelezo yanahitajika kutoa alama. Maoni bado yanapatikana.","All seven areas were assessed.":"Mada zote saba zimetathminiwa.","Interview incomplete. Unassessed areas earn no points yet; this does not mean their answers were wrong.":"Mahojiano hayajakamilika. Mada zisizotathminiwa hazina alama bado; hii haimaanishi majibu yalikuwa mabaya.","Try another mock to cover the topics listed below.":"Jaribu mahojiano mengine kushughulikia mada zifuatazo.","Keep practising clear answers in your own words.":"Endelea kufanya mazoezi ya majibu wazi kwa maneno yako.","Human review":"Tathmini ya binadamu","Add human review":"Ongeza tathmini ya binadamu","Student":"Mwanafunzi","Not recorded":"Haijarekodiwa","Mode not recorded":"Aina haijarekodiwa","No written feedback was recorded.":"Hakuna maoni yaliyoandikwa yaliyorekodiwa.","Detailed topic assessments were not recorded for this historical report.":"Ripoti hii ya zamani haina tathmini za kina zilizorekodiwa.","Private practice feedback":"Maoni binafsi ya mazoezi","Choose Save as PDF in the print dialog. On iPhone, use Share → Print to preview and save the report.":"Chagua Hifadhi kama PDF kwenye dirisha la kuchapisha. Kwenye iPhone, tumia Shiriki → Chapisha kuona na kuhifadhi.","Scoring basis: assessed topic scores only. Unanswered topics are excluded.":"Alama za mada zilizotathminiwa tu. Mada zisizojibiwa hazijumuishwi.","Assessed topic scores only; unanswered topics are excluded.":"Mada zilizotathminiwa tu; zisizojibiwa hazijumuishwi.","Assessed - score not recorded":"Imetathminiwa — alama haijarekodiwa","Focused practice":"Mazoezi maalum","Review this feedback with your tutor. Starting this lesson does not mark the issue as resolved.":"Pitia maoni haya na mkufunzi. Kuanza somo hakumaanishi tatizo limetatuliwa.","Return to regular lesson":"Rudi kwenye somo la kawaida","A student profile is needed to save notes or start a lesson.":"Wasifu wa mwanafunzi unahitajika kuhifadhi vidokezo au kuanza.","An answer, a useful point, or something to check later.":"Jibu, jambo muhimu au kitu cha kuhakikisha baadaye.","Requesting microphone…":"Inaomba maikrofoni…","Listening — answer when you’re ready.":"Ninasikiliza — jibu ukiwa tayari.","One minute remaining in this voice session.":"Dakika moja imebaki.","Switch modules without saving these notes?":"Badili moduli bila kuhifadhi vidokezo?","Return to modules without saving your changes?":"Rudi bila kuhifadhi mabadiliko?","Switch students without saving these notes?":"Badili mwanafunzi bila kuhifadhi?"},"formats":{"progress":"Moduli {0} kati ya {1} zimekamilika","module":"Moduli {0} kati ya {1}","coverage":"Mada {0} kati ya {1} zimetathminiwa","score":"Alama {0} kati ya {1} katika mada saba, zimebadilishwa kuwa alama kati ya 100.","quality":"Ubora wa mada zilizojibiwa: {0}/100. Wastani wa mada zilizotathminiwa tu.","date":"Tarehe ya mazoezi: {0}","mock":"Mahojiano ya mazoezi #{0}","adjusted":"Alama iliyorekebishwa: {0}/100","reviewer":"Mtathmini: {0}"}}};
